WEBVTT

video-title-1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Nlele

observe
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Lelee nha, ọdịdị na nhata ụmụ anya abụọ.

compare-observation
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Tụnyere ụmụ anya dị mma na mgbanwe agba ma ọ bụ ọdịdị, nha na-ahaghị nhata na mkpuchi anya.

video-title-2
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Nzaghachi kpọmkwem nye ìhè

light
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Gbanye Arclight họrọ ìhè kacha enwu. Jiri ụlọ dị jụụ nke ìhè ya pere mpe.

distance
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Gwa onye ọrịa ka o lee ihe dị anya.

clear-view
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Hụ na ọ naghị ele onye na-enyocha anya ma ọ bụ ìhè ahụ n’onwe ya.

move-light
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Bugharịa ìhè site n’akụkụ gaa n’ebe nwa anya dị.

watch
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Lelee nwa anya ìhè na-enwu na ya maka nzaghachi kpọmkwem nye ìhè.

shine-constrict
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Mee ka ìhè banye n’anya ma lelee nwa anya ka ọ na-ebelata.

compare-responses
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Lelee ma mbelata ahụ adịghị ike ma ọ bụ na ọ dịghị.

corresponding-examples
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Nzaghachi ụmụ anya dị n’aka ekpe nwere ike ijikọ na ọnọdụ azụ anya ndị e gosiri n’aka nri.

pupil-colour
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Agba nwa anya anaghị ekpebi nzaghachi ya nye ìhè.

cataract-constriction
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Cataract nwere ike ime ka nwa anya yie ntụ ntụ ma ọ bụ ọcha, mana ọ kwesịrị ibelata ma ọ bụrụ na ụzọ nzaghachi nye ìhè na-arụ ọrụ nke ọma.
